#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="ts-node"
DISPLAY_NAME="TypeScript / Node.js"

DESCRIPTION:
Server-side or fullstack TypeScript on Node.js LTS. Works for REST APIs,
CLI tools, background workers, and fullstack frameworks (Next.js, Remix, etc.).

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Runtime:       Node.js 20 LTS
- Package mgr:   pnpm (preferred) or npm
- TypeScript:    tsc (compiler), tsx (dev runner)
- Bundler:       esbuild or vite (if bundling needed)
- Linter:        ESLint + @typescript-eslint
- Formatter:     Prettier
- Test:          Vitest (preferred) or Jest
- Type check:    tsc --noEmit in CI

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.chloeai → .claude/rules/code.chloeai
- init-project.sh copies tests.chloeai → .claude/rules/tests.chloeai
- Fill in LANGUAGE_RUNTIME with Node version pin before first session
